        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">For the year ended December 31, 2025 we recorded Debits to account 411.10 totaling $83,690 and Credits of the same amount to account 230.&#160;Additionally, we recorded Credits to account 411.10 totaling $83,690 and Debits of the same amount to account 182.3 in order to defer the total depreciation on the Asset Retirement Cost asset which results in account 411.10 showing a balance of $0.</span>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-6" id="fn-6" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">
