        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">Transmission accumulated provision for depreciation includes amounts associated with the accounting for Asset Retirement Obligations ("ARO"):</span>
      </div>
