              <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">13 month average of Transmission Plant for Accounts 351.1, 351.2, and 351.3 without ARO accounting (c)</span>
            </td>
            <td style="padding:2px 0 2px 1pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:bottom">
